/E (Mechanism:  Mandates contractual Primary Data collection clauses across core operations. For Category 1, requires the top 20% core raw material suppliers \(flour, palm oil\) to report line-level emissions; for long-tail suppliers, use the average emission intensity \(tCO2e/million MYR output\) collected from the core suppliers to simulate full coverage. For Category 5, updates vendor agreements to collect itemized primary waste logs directly from third-party recovery contractors.)
