/Title (The framework developed in this study goes beyond a single-company solution for Hup Seng.  By integrating Secondary Data Modeling \(Page 6\), a Three-Tier Capture Strategy \(Pages 7 & 8\), and a Lifecycle Roadmap \(Page 9\), this project establishes a pragmatic, highly scalable blueprint.  It offers a practical entry point for mid-sized FMCG and manufacturing enterprises across Malaysia seeking to solve Scope 3 data paralysis without excessive operational burden.)
